# Icarus — Propulsive Landing Model Rocket

> A student-built model rocket targeting 1 km apogee with propulsive vertical landing recovery.

**Status:**  Early development

## About
This project aims to design, build, and fly a thrust-vectored model 
rocket capable of reaching 1 km altitude and executing a controlled 
propulsive landing — a miniature analog of orbital booster recovery.

